---
name: MiMo-V2.6-Flash on one Grace Hopper
description: "Xiaomi's 309B mixture of experts, 15B active, stored in MXFP4 (178 GB). On one GH200 the GPU keeps what it can and the rest is read from the Grace CPU's memory over the fast chip-to-chip link. Tool calling and reasoning."
engine: vllm
kind: model
model: XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.6-Flash-RL
weights_gb: 178
requires: "A vLLM nightly built after 2026-09-20 (vllm-project/vllm#57784)"
model_type: chat
api_model_name: mimo-v2.6-flash
port: 8000
health_path: /health
target_replicas: 1
max_job_failures: 2
env:
  VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S: "3600"
  PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF: expandable_segments:True
tested:
  - hardware: "1× GH200 96 GB"
    engine: "vLLM 0.30.1rc1 (nightly, Arm)"
    date: 2026-10-03
    result: "With 100 GiB in CPU memory and a 65,536-token context: ready in 13 minutes. One request ran at about 39 tokens a second; 16 at once reached 165. Tool calls worked 3 times out of 3. The GPU peaked at 86 GB and the node's memory at about 300 GB."
inputs:
  - name: context
    label: Context length
    type: choice
    options: [32768, 65536, 131072]
    default: 65536
  - name: offload
    label: Kept in CPU memory
    type: number
    min: 0
    max: 400
    unit: GiB
    default: 100
    help: How much of the weights waits in CPU memory. Lower it on a GPU with more memory; raise it if loading runs out of GPU memory.
  - name: tools
    label: Tool calling
    type: flag
    default: true
    adds: --enable-auto-tool-choice --tool-call-parser mimo
    capabilities: [function_calling, tool_choice]
  - name: reasoning
    label: Reasoning
    type: flag
    default: true
    adds: --reasoning-parser mimo
  - name: image
    label: Container image
    type: path
    default: "{{cluster.image.vllm}}"
    required: true
  - name: cache
    label: Weight cache
    type: path
    default: "{{cluster.cache}}"
    required: true
    help: HF_HOME, where the weights are kept between jobs.
---
#!/bin/bash -l
#SBATCH --gres=gpu:1
#SBATCH --cpus-per-task=72
#SBATCH --mem=0
set -euo pipefail
{{cluster.setup}}
export HF_HOME={{cache}}
apptainer exec --nv --bind {{cache}} {{image}} \
  vllm serve XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.6-Flash-RL \
    --served-model-name {{api_model_name}} \
    --host 0.0.0.0 --port "$OBLETH_SERVING_PORT" \
    --trust-remote-code --generation-config vllm \
    --max-model-len {{context}} \
    --cpu-offload-gb {{offload}} \
    --gpu-memory-utilization 0.92 \
    {{tools}} {{reasoning}}
